  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Ethiopia 2024 &#x2013; IOM WASH Solar expert</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Organization for Migration (IOM) is working on solarising water supply in a variety of regions in Ethiopia.The solar expert will provide his/her technical support for the assessment, design, estimation, implementation, and supervision of solar powered water supply systems for the water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) response in Amhara and Tigray.Additionally, the solar expert will support in capacity-building initiatives in line with the humanitarian needs in Amhara, Oromia, Tigray and Somali regions of Ethiopia.</narrative>
  </description>
